  "diagnosis_status": "source_supported",
  "diagnosis_summary": "Current public Connections Hub source launches a single workflow by calling WorkflowService.Process and returns only an active Workflow Entry form URL. Redirect actions deliberately skip HttpContext redirects during any Obsidian block action request and expose their redirect through IInteractiveAction instead. Connections Hub does not invoke that interactive-action path or return its redirect message, which supports the reported missing browser navigation on the reviewed source revision.",
  "workaround_summaries": [
    "Until Connections Hub handles interactive redirect results, do not rely on a Redirect action for a manually launched connection workflow. Use an active entry-form flow that Connections Hub can return, or launch the workflow from the classic Connection Request Board after staging verification."
  ],
